288
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:02,480
This seal and domain combination is truly overbearing.

289
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:06,150
It's time to break it !

290
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:17,660
It's devouring more energy than before...

291
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:19,770
My spiritual energy won't last long.

292
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:21,450
This won't work !

293
00:17:22,120 --> 00:17:24,130
To further weaken the seal

294
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:27,370
I can only think of one way.

295
00:17:27,520 --> 00:17:29,390
If I swallow a celestial jade,

296
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:32,250
I can fight poison with poison.

297
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:42,210
Three...

298
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:44,730
Two...

299
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:52,170
One !

300
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:56,130
Break !

301
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:11,170
I did it !

302
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:14,690
Wang Lin's avatar
Early stage
Foundation Establishment

303
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:18,570
Be quiet,

304
00:18:18,520 --> 00:18:19,770
don't disturb the Immortal.

305
00:18:24,600 --> 00:18:25,890
This breakthrough

306
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:28,170
dispersed 10 percent of the Tea Domain

307
00:18:28,790 --> 00:18:30,570
and loosened the sealing mark.

308
00:18:31,750 --> 00:18:33,370
I can now use

309
00:18:33,520 --> 00:18:34,970
most of my artifacts.

310
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:37,330
Thanks to the Mosquito Beast,

311
00:18:38,190 --> 00:18:40,620
as long as I don't meet Soul Formation cultivators,

312
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:41,760
I will be safe.

313
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,310
No matter what,

314
00:18:44,900 --> 00:18:46,090
within 7 years,

315
00:18:46,970 --> 00:18:49,250
I must recover my cultivation.

316
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:52,920
I don't have enough top quality spirit stones

317
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:55,040
to keep using them like this.

318
00:18:54,930 --> 00:18:58,050
I need a place dense in spiritual energy to cultivate.

319
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:01,370
Like the Soul Refining Sect...

320
00:18:59,520 --> 00:19:02,170
Soul Refining Sect
Country of Pilu

321
00:19:02,100 --> 00:19:04,710
One of Pilu's three great sects.

322
00:19:06,130 --> 00:19:07,550
They must have

323
00:19:08,630 --> 00:19:10,490
abundant spiritual energy.

324
00:19:31,780 --> 00:19:35,330
To let go of the consequences of my actions

325
00:19:35,080 --> 00:19:37,050
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

326
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:38,990
like scattered ink.

327
00:19:39,620 --> 00:19:46,470
As destiny falls

328
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:46,470
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

329
00:19:46,220 --> 00:19:54,070
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

330
00:19:49,460 --> 00:19:54,070
wither and melt into rivers.

331
00:19:54,260 --> 00:20:01,630
Who can deceive

332
00:19:57,020 --> 00:20:01,630
the law of the heavens ?

333
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:04,950
Countless generations

334
00:20:02,980 --> 00:20:04,950
have tried before me.

335
00:20:04,990 --> 00:20:08,670
But how could I not catch my dreams

336
00:20:06,820 --> 00:20:08,670
within my warm fingers ?

337
00:20:08,980 --> 00:20:12,750
You're at my side when I'm alone

338
00:20:12,500 --> 00:20:16,070
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

339
00:20:16,580 --> 00:20:20,030
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

340
00:20:20,140 --> 00:20:24,230
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

341
00:20:21,980 --> 00:20:24,230
in the streets.

342
00:20:24,140 --> 00:20:29,190
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

343
00:20:25,700 --> 00:20:29,190
Can I break the rules ?

344
00:20:28,950 --> 00:20:31,910
To run towards you !

345
00:20:31,700 --> 00:20:35,230
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

346
00:20:34,980 --> 00:20:39,870
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

347
00:20:39,620 --> 00:20:43,270
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

348
00:20:43,060 --> 00:20:47,950
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

349
00:20:48,150 --> 00:20:53,630
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

350
00:20:53,500 --> 00:20:57,550
If your soul is willing to wander,

351
00:20:57,300 --> 00:21:02,190
can I still take your hands

352
00:20:58,980 --> 00:21:02,190
and hold them tight ?

353
00:21:02,100 --> 00:21:05,270
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

354
00:21:05,020 --> 00:21:10,150
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

355
00:21:09,910 --> 00:21:13,430
I dream of destroying

356
00:21:13,340 --> 00:21:18,150
the shackles of our fate.

357
00:21:17,900 --> 00:21:22,110
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

358
00:21:21,860 --> 00:21:24,910
You're the hardest to let go of.

359
00:21:24,740 --> 00:21:28,790
I want to be with you again

360
00:21:28,620 --> 00:21:32,150
so I can look in your eyes.

361
00:21:32,180 --> 00:21:37,390
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
